  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2022-2026 Honda Civic (Not for Coupe Models)\nNot for Vinyl Flooring,Only fit for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCUSTOM FIT FOR HONDA CIVIC 2022–2026: YITAMOTOR floor mats are precisely 3D laser measured to deliver an accurate edge-to-edge, Fit for 2022-2026 Honda Civic Sedan Hatchback Sport/ Touring/ Type R/ EX/ EX-L/ Si/ Hybrid Sport/Hybrid Sport Touring\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Uniquely designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips to firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet.\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals needed for maintenance.\nYITAMOTOR COMMITMENT: YITAMOTOR is dedicated to precision fit and lasting durability, offering dependable floor protection for Honda Civic 2022–2026; Each mat is thoughtfully designed to match the contours of your vehicle’s interior, delivering long-term performance and a clean, integrated appearance",
